tml_url":"https://github.com/FlyingBoarStudio","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlyingBoarStudio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlyingBoarStudio/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlyingBoarStudio/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlyingBoarStudio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlyingBoarStudio/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlyingBoarStudio/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlyingBoarStudio/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlyingBoarStudio/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlyingBoarStudio/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-07T12:11:46Z","updated_at":"2026-04-07T12:12:11Z","body":"> Could you share a reproduction project? You mention it happens in an empty project but also that it implies specific settings so it would be good to have the `project.godot` as reference. For example, to confirm whether it's only using Windowed or also Borderless, etc.\n> \n> CC [@bruvzg](https://github.com/bruvzg) [@blueskythlikesclouds](https://github.com/blueskythlikesclouds)\n\n\nHello everyone sorry not familiar with github and reporting bug with open source software \n\nHere the project.godot of the empty project were the \"bug\" happening same as my main project and a video of it (couldn't record with obs as the recording stop at the moment of the bug so i used my phone as i'm not equiped for direct recording of the monitor) \n\n```\n; Engine configuration file.\n; It's best edited using the editor UI and not directly,\n; since the parameters that go here are not all obvious.\n;\n; Format:\n;   [section] ; section goes between []\n;   param=value ; assign values to parameters\n\nconfig_version=5\n\n[application]\n\nconfig/name=\"reproduction project\"\nrun/main_scene=\"uid://b5f7s5cmkhng0\"\nconfig/features=PackedStringArray(\"4.6\", \"Forward Plus\")\nconfig/icon=\"res://icon.svg\"\n\n[display]\n\nwindow/size/viewport_width=1920\nwindow/size/viewport_height=1080\n\n[physics]\n\n3d/physics_engine=\"Jolt Physics\"\n\n[rendering]\n\nrendering_device/driver.windows=\"d3d12\"\n```\n\nI don't know how to share a video on GitHub, so here's a Streamable link: https://streamable.com/hpua9m (expires in 2 days).\n\nStrangely, the bug happens less often today. Yesterday it was immediate and 100% reproducible.\n\nAlso, for an unknown and weird reason, Godot set a different resolution on the first launch: 1868×1051. It switched back to 1920×1080 after closing the run window and relaunching it.\"\n\n\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4198848727/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4198863911","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118219#issuecomment-4198863911","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118219","id":4198863911,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc76RZQn","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url"